From 8be176f94344cb1b5f40960caaf56a2c388e1cbf Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: "v7r.envy" <noreply@example.invalid>
Date: Sun, 29 Nov 2026 00:13:43 +0800
Subject: [PATCH 1/7] Live key remap and key combos

POST /api/input-remap replaces keybindings without a restart, so starting a stream from another
device no longer drops a running one. New keycombos config: [held, pressed, replacement] triples
let a held key stand in for another during a combo (Mac Cmd+Tab -> Alt+Tab on Windows).
---
